# The conformance corpus lives at the repository root, one level above this
# package, so a published package cannot carry it. The suite that runs the
# corpus is therefore left out too: a suite with nothing to run asserts
# nothing, and `dart test` reports it as a pass with skips that a reader of
# the summary line does not see. The suite is a lane of the repository, not an
# artefact of the package. `rust/Cargo.toml` leaves out `tests/` for the same
# reason.
test/
tool/
